msgid "Arc Hover Fan Delay"
msgstr ""

#: src/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.stage-manager.gschema.xml:222
msgid ""
"How long (milliseconds) the pointer must rest on a group before its windows "
"fan out in the sidebar. Clicking a group always switches to it instead, so "
"this is the only way to peek inside one. 0 disables hover fan-out."
msgstr ""

#: src/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.stage-manager.gschema.xml:228
msgid ""
