"leaves it, when the hold toggle is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: src/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.stage-manager.gschema.xml:241
msgid ""
"Hide the card (or group) that contains the currently focused window from the "
"arc sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: src/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.stage-manager.gschema.xml:247
msgid ""
"Keep previous windows visible when a new window opens (windows stack). When "
"disabled, opening a new window minimizes the others so only the newest "
"window is shown."
msgstr ""

#: src/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.stage-manager.gschema.xml:253
msgid ""
