"sidebar hides during the overview."
msgstr ""

#: src/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.stage-manager.gschema.xml:259
msgid ""
"When an application is opened from the overview and an active card/group "
"exists, join the new window to that active group instead of giving it its "
